Modified/derived artifacts: model.onnx, model.browser.onnx, model.onnx.data_*,
genai_config.json, browser-adaptation.json and manifest.json.
Weights were quantized to INT4 through Microsoft's official ONNX Runtime GenAI
builder and DEFAULT weight-only quantizer, including MatMul and Gather.
The text decoder was exported without vision or MTP. External weight data was
serialized into <=1 GiB tensor-aligned shards. The browser graph replaces six
attention-mask metadata nodes with host-supplied sequence metadata. This latter
adaptation leaves the exported numerical weights and model computation intact.
Tokenizer assets retain the upstream implementation/configuration.

Uses ONNX Runtime, ONNX Runtime GenAI and Transformers.js; this conversion is a
community project and does not imply endorsement by Alibaba or Microsoft.
